[en.DECISION_C03_INDEPENDENCE_ACTIVITY]
Independence Activity

[en.DECISION_C03_INDEPENDENCE_ACTIVITY_desc]
Shows a tendency to act independently, supporting some activities favorable to independence. If the Empire does not intervene, these activities will continue. However, if the Empire detects and takes a hard response, these activities will have to stop.

[zh.DECISION_C03_INDEPENDENCE_ACTIVITY]
独立活动

[zh.DECISION_C03_INDEPENDENCE_ACTIVITY_desc]
试探性地表现出独立的倾向，支持一些有利于独立的活动。如果帝国中央方面不加干涉，这些活动将会继续下去。但是，如果帝国中央方面发现并采取了强硬的回应，这些活动将会不得不停止。
